a, like... where is it?\", \"hmm who's gonna be at the, uh, the dormouse delivery?\", \"ah actually never mind\"], [\"I've got way too many near-duplicate pictures on here, so could you just get rid of the boat photo for me?\", \"Different thing, my afternoon's looking a bit squashed, so can you shift the quilt an hour earlier so I've got some breathing room?\", \"Also I'm filling in some forms and I've blanked, where exactly is my honfleur villa again?\", \"Oh and I want to know who I'll be running into, so who's going to be at the dormouse delivery?\", \"Actually, you know what, never mind, it doesn't really matter right now\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w25-0042\", \"v\": [[\"can u delete the shelf photo pls\"], [\"umm could you, uh, get rid of the shelf photo for me?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w25-0043\", \"v\": [[\"I'm always running late after lunch these days, so could you make the lane fifteen minutes later so I'm not rushing?\", \"Totally different thing, I'm trying to square up my spending, what did the car come to in the end?\"], [\"lane fifteen minutes later\", \"what'd the car come to?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w25-0044\", \"v\": [[\"how much does Silvio Salridge owe me in Jimhaven\"], [\"Could you tell me how much Silvio Salridge owes me in Jimhaven, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w25-0045\", \"v\": [[\"new password for gym account\", \"never mind\", \"jigsaw documents?\", \"hang on, safe gate code?\", \"back to jigsaw, in expenses too?\", \"when's the Dagny?\"], [\"umm could you come up with a password for my gym account?\", \"ah, never mind, forget it\", \"ok so, uh, can you pull up my jigsaw documents?\", \"oh hang on, quick one, what's the code for the safe gate?\", \"ok back to the jigsaw stuff, is it, um, is it in my expenses as well?\", \"and uh, when do I have the Dagny?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w25-0047\", \"v\": [[\"remove Isak note\", \"wait, put it back\", \"who's at the Lyudmila?\", \"photos of any of them?\"], [\"umm can you remove the Isak note?\", \"oh no wait, scratch that, put it back\", \"ok so, uh, who am I seeing at the Lyudmila?\", \"hmm do I have a photo of any of them?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w25-0048\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please reserve a table at Cosmere Sands for saturday?\", \"Also, would you mind ticking off the gondola task for me?\"], [\"table at Cosmere Sands saturday\", \"tick off gondola task\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w25-0049\", \"v\": [[\"what did i get done this week\", \"which of those dont have a due date\"], [\"Could you tell me what I completed this week, please?\", \"Thank you. Would you mind telling me which of those have no due date?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w25-0051\", \"v\": [[\"delete the villa safe entry from my locker pls\", \"no wait undo that\", \"how much have i spent on Jimhaven total\", \"whats the actual password tho\"], [\"Could you please delete the villa safe entry from my locker?\", \"Oh, no wait, would you undo that, please?\", \"On a different note, could you tell me how much I've spent on Jimhaven in total?\", \"Thank you. Could you also give me the actual password, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w25-0052\", \"v\": [[\"umm does Varir Papadakis owe me anything?\", \"ok and, uh, Rania Aguilar?\", \"and what about... Hana Chowdhury?\"], [\"I'm trying to get a handle on who still owes me money before I lose track, so does Varir Papadakis owe me anything at the moment?\", \"Right, and what about Rania Aguilar, anything outstanding there?\", \"Last one, I promise, and Hana Chowdhury?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w25-0053\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to get my paperwork in order and I can never find anything, so could you show me what documents I've got linked to Kelloe Deli?\"], [\"umm what documents have I got, like, linked to Kelloe Deli?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w25-0054\", \"v\": [[\"what's on while in Honfleur?\", \"second one to thursday, cancel the fourth\", \"coffee with Isak tuesday at nine\"], [\"Could you tell me what I have on while I'm away in Honfleur, please?\", \"Thank you. Would you mind moving the second one to thursday and cancelling the fourth one?\", \"Also, could you please book in coffee with Isak on tuesday at nine?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w25-0055\", \"v\": [[\"who's in the garden pic?\", \"number for Salome\", \"add Blessing to the group\", \"canvas delivery an hour later\", \"wrong one, meant larch repair\", \"what's left for tuesday?\"], [\"Could you tell me who's in the garden picture, please?\", \"Thank you. Could you give me the phone number for Salome?\", \"Also, would you mind adding Blessing to the group?\", \"Separately, could you please push the canvas delivery an hour later?\", \"I'm sorry, that was the wrong event, I meant the larch repair one.\", \"Could you tell me what I still need to get done on tuesday, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w25-0056\", \"v\": [[\"Would you please add a task to order more skylark for the 18th?\"], [\"We're running a bit low and I keep forgetting to sort it, so could you add a task to order more skylark for the 18th?\"]]}","ttft_ms":9157,"type":"result","duration_ms":26754,"uuid":"e70ce665-6458-4a05-9df4-2ede8c694f42","ttft_stream_ms":1538,"time_to_request_ms":161,"first_content_frame_ms":1539,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22312513,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278863012.325,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
